---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Deep Research — Fathom Research">
  <main class="fr-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="fr-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/features" class="crumb">Features</a> / <span data-i18n-html data-i18n="featuresResearch.hero.crumb">Research</span></p>
        <h1 class="h2-sec" data-i18n-html data-i18n="featuresResearch.hero.title">Deep web research,<br />multiplied.</h1>
        <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="featuresResearch.hero.sub">Seven search backends, hybrid fusion, hierarchical fan-out and cross-referencing — an answer assembled from the whole web, not the first page.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Capabilities -->
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.badge">Capabilities</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.title">How Fathom researches the web</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="api-grid">
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">7 search backends</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.backends">Linkup, Parallel.ai, Exa, Tavily, Serper, Brave, DuckDuckGo — with hybrid and smart modes and RRF ranking to fuse results.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Hierarchical fan-out</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.fanout">spawn_agent at any depth up to max_depth; batches of children run in parallel, background mode reports results as notifications.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Deep fetch &amp; crawl</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.fetch">web_fetch, web_crawl and web_feed pull full pages, follow sitemaps and parse RSS at up to 1.1M items/s.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Structured parsing</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.parsing">parse_html (531k rows/s) and extract_json turn any document into structured data.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Browser &amp; vision</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.vision">Real Chrome via CDP when the page fights back; analyze_image for screenshots, charts and documents.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Code-aware research</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.cap.code">code_symbols and repo_map map codebases; PDF extraction reads whitepapers and filings.</p></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison -->
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.badge">Comparison</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.title">Fathom vs. manual research</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cmp">
        <div class="cmp-col">
          <h3 class="cmp-name cmp-name--bad" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.head">Manual</h3>
          <ul>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.0">Hours per topic, one tab at a time</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.1">Single search engine, first-page bias</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.2">Copy-paste into spreadsheets</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.3">No verification, stale data</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.manual.4">Nothing remembered next week</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-col cmp-col--good">
          <h3 class="cmp-name" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.head">Fathom</h3>
          <ul>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.0">Minutes per topic, parallel agents</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.1">7 backends fused with RRF ranking</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.2">Structured findings + exports</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.3">Verified contacts, cross-referenced facts</li>
            <li data-i18n="featuresResearch.cmp.parallel.4">Semantic memory carries knowledge forward</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Under the hood -->
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.badge">Under the hood</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.title">Multi-agent fan-out explained</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flow">
        <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-num">1</span><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.0.title">Plan</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.0.desc">LLM decomposes the query into sub-tasks; subtasks persist in SQLite.</p></div>
        <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-num">2</span><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.1.title">Fan out</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.1.desc">Coordinator spawns sub-agents (JoinSet or separate OS processes).</p></div>
        <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-num">3</span><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.2.title">Collect</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.2.desc">Budget-capped summaries flow back; context stays small.</p></div>
        <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-num">4</span><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.3.title">Reflect</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.3.desc">Goal Mode: an LLM judge checks the result against the goal and runs gap-filling rounds.</p></div>
        <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-num">5</span><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.4.title">Synthesize</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.flow.4.desc">Findings merge into summary.md + findings/, absorbed into memory.</p></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Agent roles -->
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.badge">Agent roles</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.title">Five roles, one pipeline</h2>
        <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n-html data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.sub">Every agent runs a role-specific prompt on top of the same runtime. Roles can be overridden per deployment via <code class="ic">[agent.role_models]</code>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="api-grid">
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Coordinator</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.0.desc">Decomposes the query into 2–5 sub-tasks, delegates, and synthesizes the final answer.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Researcher</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.1.desc">Web search + OSINT / lead-gen workflows with source citation.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Analyst</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.2.desc">Cross-references findings, spots patterns and contradictions, assigns HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW confidence labels via the system prompt.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Verifier</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.3.desc">Adversarial fact-checking: Verified / Partial / Unverified.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">Writer</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.4.desc">Structures the report: Summary / Findings / Analysis / Sources / Gaps.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name">3-tier prompts</div><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.roles.5.desc">Stable / context / volatile prompt layers maximize prefix-cache hit rates across the fleet.</p></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Use cases -->
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.badge">Use cases</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.title">Built for real business scenarios</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-grid">
        <div class="uc-card"><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.0.title">Market &amp; competitor scans</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.0.desc">Track pricing, positioning and hiring across an industry — with diffs between runs.</p></div>
        <div class="uc-card"><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.1.title">Due diligence</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.1.desc">Company facts, news, filings and key people into one verified dossier.</p></div>
        <div class="uc-card"><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.2.title">Lead research</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.2.desc">Decision-makers at target companies, enriched and verified before outreach.</p></div>
        <div class="uc-card"><h3 data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.3.title">Tech scouting</h3><p data-i18n="featuresResearch.uc.3.desc">Map repos, extract symbols, summarize documentation with code_symbols + repo_map.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-strip">
        <h2 data-i18n="featuresResearch.cta.title">Start researching today</h2>
        <a href="/#cta" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="featuresResearch.cta.start">Get started →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .fr-page { padding: 70px 0 90px; }
  .ic { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .85em; background: var(--grey-100); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 5px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .eyebrow .crumb { color: var(--grey-500); }
  .eyebrow .crumb:hover { color: var(--grey-900); }
  .h3-sec { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .copy-lg { color: var(--grey-700); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 640px; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .fr-hero { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; }
  .fr-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; margin-top: 12px; }
  .fr-hero .copy-lg { margin-top: 20px; }

  .sec-head { max-width: 720px; margin: 60px 0 28px; }

  .api-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); }
  .api-card { background: var(--bg-card); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .api-card .api-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
  .api-card p { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .api-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .cmp { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
  .cmp-col { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px; }
  .cmp-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .cmp-col li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--grey-600); padding-left: 18px; position: relative; }
  .cmp-col li::before { content: '·'; position: absolute; left: 2px; color: var(--grey-400); }
  .cmp-name { font-size: 15px; font-family: var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .cmp-col--good { background: var(--bg-dark); border-color: var(--grey-300); }
  .cmp-col--good .cmp-name { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
  .cmp-col--good li { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
  .cmp-col--good li::before { content: '✓'; color: #a8ccb0; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .cmp { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .flow-step { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 20px; }
  .flow-num { display: inline-flex; width: 26px; height: 26px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--grey-900); color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .flow-step h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .flow-step p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--grey-600); line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .flow { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .uc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .uc-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px; }
  .uc-card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .uc-card p { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .uc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .cta-strip { margin-top: 64px; background: var(--bg-dark); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cta-strip h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cta-strip .btn-primary { background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--grey-900); }
</style>
